        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin 6570 Contemporary Mortise Atlanta Handleset with 5073 Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 6570 Atlanta Handleset features a sleek, modern design with concealed crew mounting. It is available with a single cylinder, a double cylinder, or a dummy set function so you will be sure to find just the right one to meet your application needs. This solid brass handleset is finished with the truly contemporary 5073 Octagon Knob.  It will fit 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" door thicknesses and with backsets of 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\".\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMortise locks have been, and still are, the established norm for Europe and much of the rest of the world. In the early 1960’s Baldwin brought residential mortise locks to America. They ‘founded’ the residential mortise industry and continue to be the leader – so much so that their competitors have bought Baldwin products for their own homes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also Available: Matching <a href=\"/products/contemporary-octagon-knobset-baldwin-5073\"><b>Baldwin 5073 Octagon Knobset</b></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Modern 6570 Atlanta Door Entrance Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid forged brass for maximum strength and durability.</li>\r\n<li>Heavy duty steel mortise lock body for a lifetime of trouble-free operation.  </li>\r\n<li>Mortise locks have adjustable forged brass lock fronts, protected by armored scalp fronts for ultimate strength and protection against tampering.</li>\r\n<li>Forged brass and steel mechanical.</li>\r\n<li>Locks and strikes fit standard ANSI A115.1 preparation.</li>\r\n<li>Reinforced steel security strike with three inch screws.</li>\r\n<li>Anti friction latch bolt with 3/4” throw.  </li>\r\n<li>1” throw deadbolt has two hardened steel inserts for maximum protection and security.</li>\r\n<li>7mm hub broached on the diamond</li>\r\n<li>Certified by Underwriters Laboratories (UL) for use on fire doors up to three-hour rating.</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime Limited Warranty</b> on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Modern Estates Collection Atlanta Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Interior Trim: 5073 Knob</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Overall Length: 16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Overall Width: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Length: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Exterior Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Length: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Knob Diameter: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Interior Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Hub to Turn Piece Length: 2.25\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Hub to Cylinder Length: 3.437\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" or 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset:  2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-6570.pdf?v=1691094972\" target=\"new\"><b>Atlanta Handleset Specification Sheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-estate_mortise_dimensions.pdf?v=1691094972\" target=\"new\"><b>Mortise Box Specification Sheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob operates the latch.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates handleset latch; while from the interior, it is operated by a knob. The deadbolt is operated by a key from both the inside and the outside.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-3-Functions.jpg?v=1704354551\" width=\"350\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Baldwin Functions Chart\"></p>",
